MAQTEL MEIN SADA DETE THE YE SARWAR-E-ALAM<br>
JEENE NAHI DEGA HAME ABBAS TERA GHAM<br>
<br>
BABA NE MUJHE TUMKO DIYA THA YEHI KEHKAR<br>
ABBAS TERA SAATH NIBHAYEGA BARABAR<br>
KYA BAAT HAI KYU RUTH GAYA MERA BARADAR<br>
<br>
SOTI THI JO AARAM NAHI PAYEGI AANKHEIN<br>
AARAM SE SOJAYEGI AB JAAGTI AANKHEIN<br>
 JO BAND HUI MERE ALAMDAR KI ANKHEIN<br>
 <br>
 HO JAYEGI BE PARDA MERI ZAINAB-E-MUZTAR<br>
CHIN JAYENGEY KAANAO SE SAKINA KEY BHI GOUHAR<br>
CHARD JAYEGA NAIZE KI BULANDI PA MERA SAR<br>
<br>
GHAR LUTKE LEJAYENGEY BEY DARD SITAMGAR<br>
SHOLOUN MEIN BADAL JAYEGA ABBAS MERA GHAR<br>
BALWE MEIN HARAM HOYENGEY BE MAQNA-O-CHADAR<br>
<br>
BARCHI JIGAR PEY KHAYEGA RUN MEIN MERA AKBER<br>
HATOUN PE MERE TEERE JAFA KHAYEGA ASGHAR<br>
KIS YAAS-O-BEKASI SE BAYAN KARTE THE SARWAR<br>
<br>
ABID PE MUSIBAT KI GHADI AAYEGI BHAIYA<br>
FOUJ-E-YAZID USPE SITAM DHAYEGI BHAIYA<br>
TOUQ-E-GIRAAN BUQAR MEIN PEHNAYENGEY BHAIYA<br>
<br>
UNCHA RAHEGA DAHAIR MEIN GHAZI TERA PARCHAM<br>
HOTA RAHEGA GHAM ZADA SHABBIR KA MATAM<br>
DUNIYA BHULANA PAYEGI ABBAS TERA GHAM<br>
<br>
AYE KHUWATTE BAZU MERE AYE NASERE IMAN<br>
ABBAS-E-DILAWAR MERE ABBAS MERI JAAN<br>
MAZHAR YEHI DETE THE SADA SARWAR-E-ZEESHAN
